  "sentence": {
    "text": "Yeah. So I'd like to use this introduction to tell you more about the program and particularly to point to a couple of inherent qualities of awareness that really light up this program. And maybe before that, just a little about my own background. I spent the first few years of my practice back in the early 90s in Asian monasteries and with Himalayan hermits. I was mostly practicing and training in the Thai forest tradition, but I also did quite a lot of cross-training, you could say, in various Tibetan practices, Mahamudra and Dzogchen, and then also some of the Hindu-Sivite practices.",
    "start_time": 0.0,
    "end_time": 41.54
  },
